[{"client_msg_id":"87e63d05-4ce5-4043-be40-686e513f2f47","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"いや、CMで入るので…","ts":"1628348371.026600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LYz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5fad11f4-8a51-4011-a29f-b4659ea60ef8","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"いや、あれこれ言ってますけど私アニメすら見てないので言っても仕方ない気もしてきた :bow:","ts":"1628348358.026000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E/R1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"122d5100-ecd3-497f-82a4-67dc7549bfde","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"いや、そもそも興味がなかったらこのアーティストがバンドリと言う作品内のアーティストだってことすら知らんのでは?","ts":"1628348307.025300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JsFr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"80362bcc-be7d-4c9f-b787-5d9fa47af07e","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u0026gt; 独立したアーティスト\n\u0026gt; \nそんなことはバンドリに興味がないと知らないので…\nシングルも別曲のオマケ(B面)扱いで出るし","ts":"1628348264.024800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q1PEk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"02f6b31c-af0c-4b39-acd1-fe18007e04b0","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"実際のところどうなんだろう。私も詳しくないです","ts":"1628348142.022200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o5Q4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b7489e24-5968-425a-b47c-5dcb0862aa46","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そもそも単に独立したアーティストと言う認識だった","ts":"1628348128.021700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PDU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0f37b241-77fd-4dfa-b1a7-ea713edeb9c2","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"全く関係ないアニメに採用するのはゴリ押しかなーって…\n政治感あるキャスティングで…","ts":"1628348105.021400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bPC"}